ont-family: 나눔고딕\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학생 개인 모든 정보 관리 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">? </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">금오공과대학교 원스톱서비스 로긴 장학수혜내역 확인가능</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학사일정에 따른 학생의 모든 학사</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">장학 안내 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #1919ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학교홈페이지 공지사항 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #1919ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #1919ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학사안내 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #efefef; HEIGHT: 21.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교내 성적우수장학금은 어떻게 받을 수 있나요 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">?</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 88.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학년부터 외국어 성적 취득은 필수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">!</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">공인외국어성적</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">교내모의토익가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">그리고 기타 장학종별 성적우수장학 대상 요건충족된 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학생중 학과장 추천 </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">어학성적 없을 경우 평점 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4.5</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">로 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">등이어도 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">성적우수장학선발에서 제외</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">어학성적 인정기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">최근 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">년이내 취득한 성적이어야 함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">졸업까지 매년 취득한 성적 있어야 함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">신입학 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학년은 입학성적으로 선발합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #efefef; HEIGHT: 21.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">국가 장학금은 어떻게 해야 받을수 있나요 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">?</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 37.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">한국장학재단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">에 신청하여 소득분위에 따라 승인된 학생에 대하여 선발합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">자세한 사항은 한국장학재단 홈페이지에서 확인 할 수 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학교홈페이지 신청안내등 공지함</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #efefef; HEIGHT: 21.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">등록금 납부할 금액이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘0’ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">인 학생도</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">은행에 수납처리 반드시 해야함</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 37.31pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0c0cff; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">고지서에 납부할 금액이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0c0cff; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘0’</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0c0cff; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">인 학생도 반드시 은행의 수납인을 받아야 납부완료 처리됨</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0c0cff; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">만약 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">수납</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">등록처리 하지 않을시 장학취소 및 미등록처리 됨</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #efefef; HEIGHT: 21.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">？ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">장학금액은 얼마인가요 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">? </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 479.47pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 144.63pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">장학종류별 다르지만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">등록금 범위내에서 이중지급</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">됩니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">국가장학금 등록금 전액 받은 학생은 다른장학금은 받을 수 없구요</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">수학보조비성 경비 지원 장학금은 등록금을 초과하여 지급합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">예</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">학과최우수 입학자는 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">등인 경우 발전기금최우수입학장학금 등록금 전액을 받고</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">수학보조비 학기별 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1,000,000</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">원을 추가로 지급합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">단</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">성적요건 충족한 경우에만</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">예</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">등록금 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">백만원인 경우(등록금범위내 이중지급가능)</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">준우등 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">30</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">만원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">스마일장학 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">50</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">만원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">형제자매 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">50</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">만원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">국가장학70</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">만원 받을수 있음</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕\">● </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">장학종류별 장학금액 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">홈페이지</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">대학생활</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #b20000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">장학안내 참조 </span></u></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt so